%A Boolean formula $\varphi$ involving variables $x_1,\ldots,x_n$ will correspond to the equations $\psi(\varphi)=0$ and $y_i^2-y_i=0$ with $i=1,\ldots,n$. Here, the polynomial $\psi(\varphi)\in\mathbb{Z}[y_1,\ldots,y_n]$ is defined as follows.

