+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: exact Walsh-Hadamard inversion solves the promised family in "
+        "O(blocks*n*log2(n)*4) arithmetic operations; at the shipping preset "
+        "the reference implementation uses 1,926 exact arithmetic operations "
+        "(wall-clock measured in selftest), whereas the zero-character compact "
+        "route uses 192 exact operations but must be recognized and executed "
